to: pastry-chef
topic: dessert-menu

Read docs/menu-direction.md for the full shared direction, constraints, and
pantry before starting.

Deliver:
1. 4 dessert a la carte dishes for Ember & Olive (Mediterranean coastal
   theme: honey, date syrup, phyllo, stone fruit, figs, pistachio, citrus,
   sheep/goat dairy). Butter is allowed here even though savory dishes use
   olive oil.
2. Tasting menu course 7 (the dessert course), continuing the story arc
   after sauce-chef's savory courses 1-6.
3. Any shared bread/dough components used elsewhere on the menu (e.g. for
   the hearth), noted separately.
4. Every dish must include: name, short description, primary components,
   cooking method, accompanying sauce/condiment or garnish, and nut-allergy
   label.

No em dashes. Return your recipes in the standard envelope so recipe-tester
can evaluate them next.
